Because &lt;code&gt;@smartspectra/node-sdk&lt;/code&gt; is a native desktop C++/FFI addon, the hosted Vercel app boots directly into &lt;strong&gt;Recorded Sample Trace&lt;/strong&gt; mode—replaying the exact &lt;code&gt;670&lt;/code&gt;-keyframe (&lt;code&gt;352.40 s&lt;/code&gt; span) narrated Windows capture at 1× speed—plus &lt;strong&gt;Keyboard Interactive Mode&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;code&gt;Space&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;←/↑/→&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Shift&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
