&lt;p&gt;The first two screenshots below are captured running the bundled &lt;strong&gt;Recorded Sample Trace&lt;/strong&gt; on the built frontend; Step 03 and the dark-theme &lt;strong&gt;Solar Coral&lt;/strong&gt; Contact Sheet were exported directly from live Windows webcam sittings:&lt;/p&gt;

