&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Frg2cgx34zr4yp3z9bigs.png" class="article-body-image-wrapper"&gt;&lt;img src="https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Frg2cgx34zr4yp3z9bigs.png" alt="Developed Contact Sheet PNG exported from Sitting 3 on the live Windows webcam bridge: 239.2s, 15 blink cuts, 72% breath clarity, AVG PULSE 75.4 BPM opt-in, L/C/R gaze bars" width="800" height="460"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;em&gt;Step 03 (&lt;code&gt;/contact-sheet&lt;/code&gt;, Sitting 3 live narrated export): &lt;code&gt;239.2 s&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;15&lt;/code&gt; blink cuts, &lt;code&gt;72%&lt;/code&gt; breath clarity, &lt;code&gt;AVG PULSE 75.4 BPM (§7.4)&lt;/code&gt;, mixed &lt;code&gt;L / C / R&lt;/code&gt; gaze bars, and &lt;code&gt;15/15&lt;/code&gt; notes unlocked.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Sitting 3 reveals at a glance:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Live speech protection (&lt;code&gt;807 / 807&lt;/code&gt; checks):&lt;/strong&gt; Speaking aloud across &lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;15&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; narrated episodes (&lt;code&gt;57&lt;/code&gt; keyframes in &lt;code&gt;sample-trace.json&lt;/code&gt;) kept chest steadiness cleanly locked (&lt;code&gt;72%&lt;/code&gt; avg clarity, &lt;code&gt;15/15&lt;/code&gt; hidden notes) with &lt;code&gt;0&lt;/code&gt; drift violations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Honest opt-in pulse gating (&lt;code&gt;75.4 bpm&lt;/code&gt; avg):&lt;/strong&gt; After flipping &lt;code&gt;cardioMetrics&lt;/code&gt; ON mid-sitting, &lt;strong&gt;Plates II–IV&lt;/strong&gt; print &lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;71.8 / 77.1 / 77.2 bpm&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;, while &lt;strong&gt;Plate I&lt;/strong&gt; (pre-toggle) and &lt;strong&gt;Plate V&lt;/strong&gt; (where the ~95% gray Left bar shows looking far left, dropping rPPG confidence &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt; 40%&lt;/code&gt;) stay honestly blank (&lt;code&gt;null&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Telemetry caught one last edge case:&lt;/strong&gt; Long-blink pause #3 (&lt;code&gt;dt = 289.947 s&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;ear = 0.213&lt;/code&gt;) exposed a &lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;42 ms&lt;/code&gt; eyelid-descent race&lt;/strong&gt; right before a &lt;code&gt;2.44 s&lt;/code&gt; closure hold, fixed by &lt;code&gt;nativeBlinkEarFloor = 0.25&lt;/code&gt; and locked in by Regression Test #21.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Ffpcmdsz9bl4vpi59slfi.png" class="article-body-image-wrapper"&gt;&lt;img src="https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Ffpcmdsz9bl4vpi59slfi.png" alt="Dark-theme Solar Coral Contact Sheet from an earlier rehearsal sitting showing 194.7s, 57% breath clarity, and honest dashed flatlines on Plates II to IV" width="800" height="460"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;em&gt;Dark-theme **Solar Coral&lt;/em&gt;* variant (&lt;code&gt;194.7 s&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;57%&lt;/code&gt; breath clarity): when chest signal stalled on Plates II–IV, the sheet drew honest dashed baselines (&lt;code&gt;0/3&lt;/code&gt; notes) rather than smoothing over the gap.*&lt;/p&gt;


