&lt;div class="markdown-heading"&gt;
&lt;h1 class="heading-element"&gt;AFTERIMAGE&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;A blink is a cut, not a click. Breathe steady to hold the frame still.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AFTERIMAGE&lt;/strong&gt; is a five-scene interactive visual essay navigated without touching a keyboard, powered by the &lt;strong&gt;Presage SmartSpectra Node.js SDK (&lt;code&gt;@smartspectra/node-sdk@3.5.0&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/strong&gt;. Inspired by film editor &lt;a href="https://www.imdb.com/name/nm0004555/" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Walter Murch&lt;/strong&gt;'s&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/In_the_Blink_of_an_Eye_%28book%29" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer"&gt;&lt;em&gt;In the Blink of an Eye&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt; (the observation that a human blink punctuates one thought from the next alongside the rhythm of breathing) and the blink-driven memory storytelling of &lt;a href="https://www.imdb.com/title/tt15575678/" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Before Your Eyes&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, AFTERIMAGE turns involuntary webcam signals into slow darkroom controls: where you look shifts focus across a three-panel plate, chest breathing steadiness clears optical haze and develops hidden marginalia, and every natural blink turns the page once a &lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;4.2 s&lt;/code&gt; Shutter Armed&lt;/strong&gt; dwell lock clears—ending in an exportable &lt;strong&gt;Contact Sheet (&lt;code&gt;.png&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/strong&gt; of your sitting.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Built as a solo submission for the &lt;a href="https://dev.to/challenges/presage-2026-11-04" rel="nofollow"&gt;Presage SmartSpectra SDK Challenge&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

