&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;No packet capture on Presage's §7.4 gateway:&lt;/strong&gt; The Consent section below states strictly what Presage's SDK 3.5.0 source code and docs specify rather than claiming a wire-level network audit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;




&lt;h2&gt;


  Prize Categories
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I am entering &lt;strong&gt;Most Creative or Delightful Use&lt;/strong&gt; (in addition to Overall consideration):&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Directly inspired by &lt;a href="https://www.imdb.com/name/nm0004555/" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Walter Murch&lt;/strong&gt;'s&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/In_the_Blink_of_an_Eye_%28book%29" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;&lt;em&gt;In the Blink of an Eye&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://www.imdb.com/title/tt15575678/" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Before Your Eyes&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;AFTERIMAGE&lt;/strong&gt; turns contactless webcam sensing from a vitals chart into slow darkroom cinema: an eye glance shifts panel sharpness and stereo WebAudio harmonies, calm chest breathing clears SVG optical haze to wake hidden italic marginalia (&lt;code&gt;15/15&lt;/code&gt; unlocked on Sitting 3, honestly stalling to dashed flatlines when signal drops), a &lt;code&gt;4.2 s&lt;/code&gt; dwell gate turns ordinary blinks from nuisance triggers into deliberate film cuts (&lt;code&gt;30&lt;/code&gt; reading blinks absorbed cleanly so &lt;code&gt;34&lt;/code&gt; intentional cuts told the story), and the sitting ends by printing an honest &lt;code&gt;1600×920&lt;/code&gt; Contact Sheet you can download or erase in one click.&lt;/p&gt;




&lt;h2&gt;


  Consent and Data Handling
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Camera stays off until explicit consent:&lt;/strong&gt; Video capture never starts on load. On &lt;code&gt;/calibrate&lt;/code&gt;, Live Bridge mode requires checking consent and clicking to start; closing or navigating away stops capture cleanly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;No raw video or audio stored:&lt;/strong&gt; Native Node decodes camera frames locally at &lt;code&gt;960×540 @ 30fps&lt;/code&gt; on &lt;code&gt;127.0.0.1:4199&lt;/code&gt; and discards them from RAM immediately. Only normalized &lt;code&gt;[0..1]&lt;/code&gt; geometric silhouette vectors and scalar blink/gaze/breath values traverse localhost WebSocket. Microphone permission is never requested.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;SDK telemetry OFF &amp;amp; &lt;code&gt;requestInsight()&lt;/code&gt; never called:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href="https://github.com/emarc99/presage-dev/blob/main/bridge/server.mjs" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;&lt;code&gt;bridge/server.mjs&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; constructs every SDK instance with &lt;code&gt;enableTelemetry: false&lt;/code&gt; and never calls &lt;code&gt;sdk.requestInsight()&lt;/code&gt;. Both invariants are asserted on every CI push in &lt;code&gt;npm test&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;npm run verify-trace&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Accurate Presage §7.4 LLM Insights disclosure:&lt;/strong&gt; Leaving &lt;code&gt;cardioMetrics&lt;/code&gt; &lt;strong&gt;OFF by default&lt;/strong&gt; requests only &lt;code&gt;faceMetrics + breathingMetrics&lt;/code&gt;, so pulse and HRV are never computed or buffered. However, inspection of Presage's &lt;a href="https://smartspectra.presagetech.com/docs/llm-insights" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;LLM Insights docs&lt;/a&gt;, Privacy Policy §7.4, and &lt;code&gt;@smartspectra/node-sdk@3.5.0&lt;/code&gt; source (&lt;code&gt;_ensureSession()&lt;/code&gt; registers &lt;code&gt;onInsight&lt;/code&gt; unconditionally) shows that when &lt;code&gt;breathing.rate&lt;/code&gt; (or &lt;code&gt;cardio&lt;/code&gt; when enabled) is active, the SDK automatically dispatches short derived numeric series (never raw video) to Presage's Analytics Gateway / Anthropic LLM service and cannot currently be turned off by developers. AFTERIMAGE discloses this plainly upfront on &lt;code&gt;/calibrate&lt;/code&gt;, never requests or displays AI insights, and warns inline before opt-in &lt;code&gt;cardioMetrics&lt;/code&gt; is switched ON (plus suppressing &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt; 40%&lt;/code&gt; confidence pulse readings due to camera rPPG sensitivity in dim lighting and Fitzpatrick V–VI skin tones).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Opt-in trace recording &amp;amp; one-click erasure:&lt;/strong&gt; Local trace recording (&lt;code&gt;.jsonl&lt;/code&gt; inside gitignored &lt;code&gt;recordings/&lt;/code&gt;, or &lt;code&gt;web/public/sample-trace.json&lt;/code&gt;) runs only when explicitly invoked, and &lt;code&gt;/contact-sheet&lt;/code&gt; provides one-click in-memory erasure (&lt;code&gt;Erase Session Data&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Non-medical notice:&lt;/strong&gt; AFTERIMAGE is an interactive digital art and narrative experiment for creative and informational purposes only; it is not a medical device and makes no diagnosis or treatment claims.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;




