&lt;h3 id="agent-session-1410-15-why-it-got-stuck-observed-on-your-live-bridge"&gt;Why It Got Stuck (Observed on Your Live Bridge)&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;30 Hz hardware enumeration storm (&lt;code&gt;bridge/server.mjs&lt;/code&gt;):&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;code&gt;validationStatus&lt;/code&gt; was firing ~25×/sec even when &lt;code&gt;validation&lt;/code&gt; stayed &lt;code&gt;kOk&lt;/code&gt;, and &lt;code&gt;buildStatusPayload()&lt;/code&gt; called &lt;code&gt;SmartSpectraSDK.availableCameras()&lt;/code&gt; on every single broadcast.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Startup &lt;code&gt;talking&lt;/code&gt; trap (&lt;code&gt;bridge/signal-processor.mjs&lt;/code&gt;):&lt;/strong&gt; A single &lt;code&gt;face.talking&lt;/code&gt; flicker engaged the 1.2 s freeze before the first chest wave computed, pinning &lt;code&gt;breathSteadiness&lt;/code&gt; at its &lt;code&gt;55&lt;/code&gt; default.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Resting expression &amp;amp; blink sensitivity:&lt;/strong&gt; Your live packets emitted resting &lt;code&gt;echo: "heavy"&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;code&gt;SAD&lt;/code&gt; at rest) and open &lt;code&gt;ear&lt;/code&gt; around &lt;code&gt;0.298–0.313&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;60 Hz UI thrash (&lt;code&gt;ExperiencePage.tsx&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;useSignals.ts&lt;/code&gt;):&lt;/strong&gt; React committed every 30 Hz signal frame, re-bound &lt;code&gt;registerBlinkHandler&lt;/code&gt; on every render, and drove &lt;code&gt;SceneArt&lt;/code&gt;'s SVG &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;feGaussianBlur&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt; at 60 fps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h3 id="agent-session-1410-15-fixes-shipped-b82bbce"&gt;Fixes Shipped (&lt;code&gt;b82bbce&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;bridge/server.mjs&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt; Cached camera enumeration (&lt;code&gt;refreshCameras&lt;/code&gt;, refreshed on explicit &lt;code&gt;list_cameras&lt;/code&gt; or every 10 s on &lt;code&gt;/health&lt;/code&gt;) and suppressed duplicate &lt;code&gt;validationStatus&lt;/code&gt; broadcasts when &lt;code&gt;(validation, validationHint)&lt;/code&gt; is unchanged.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;bridge/signal-processor.mjs&lt;/code&gt; &amp;amp; &lt;code&gt;signal-processor.test.mjs&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Requires &lt;code&gt;&amp;gt;= 5&lt;/code&gt; consecutive &lt;code&gt;face.talking&lt;/code&gt; frames (&lt;code&gt;talkingOnsetFrames = 5&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;900 ms&lt;/code&gt; hold) and never freezes initial warmup before the first chest breath calculation completes (&lt;code&gt;hasComputedBreath&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raised &lt;code&gt;earBlinkThreshold&lt;/code&gt; &lt;code&gt;0.19&lt;/code&gt; → &lt;code&gt;0.21&lt;/code&gt; to reliably catch quick 30 fps blinks on reopen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Calibrated &lt;code&gt;echo&lt;/code&gt; &lt;code&gt;heavy&lt;/code&gt; threshold (&lt;code&gt;&amp;gt;= 86%&lt;/code&gt; at &lt;code&gt;0.90/0.10&lt;/code&gt; EMA) so focused resting faces stay &lt;code&gt;neutral&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;web/src/hooks/useSignals.ts&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt; Commits discrete events (&lt;code&gt;blinkCut&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;longBlinkPause&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;gaze&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;talking&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;echo&lt;/code&gt;) immediately, throttles continuous waveform/phase UI updates to &lt;code&gt;~12.5 Hz&lt;/code&gt;, and auto-reconnects the WebSocket every &lt;code&gt;1.5 s&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;web/src/pages/ExperiencePage.tsx&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt; Added the compact 1-line &lt;strong&gt;Gesture Guide Bar&lt;/strong&gt; above the stage (&lt;code&gt;Look L/C/R to shift focus · Breathe steadily (≥ 60%) to sharpen &amp;amp; unlock note · Blink after 4.2 s to cut · Hold 1.1 s to pause&lt;/code&gt;) plus inline live framing hints when &lt;code&gt;validation !== 'kOk'&lt;/code&gt;, decoupled &lt;code&gt;stopLiveBridge&lt;/code&gt; from handler re-registration, and capped drift parallax updates to &lt;code&gt;~15 fps&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Checks after final edit:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;code&gt;node --check&lt;/code&gt; passed on both bridge files, &lt;code&gt;npm test&lt;/code&gt; passed &lt;strong&gt;9/9&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;code&gt;102.50 ms&lt;/code&gt;), and &lt;code&gt;npm run build&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;code&gt;tsc -b &amp;amp;&amp;amp; vite build&lt;/code&gt;) exited &lt;code&gt;0&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;code&gt;1.32 s&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;


