- &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://dev.to/timothy_akanbi/long-exposure-a-daguerreotype-that-takes-a-minute-because-the-sdk-does-113l"&gt;Long Exposure&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;code&gt;timothy_akanbi&lt;/code&gt;): &lt;strong&gt;Same darkroom / photographic plate metaphor as AFTERIMAGE&lt;/strong&gt;, WebGL silver-plate shader, &lt;strong&gt;56 unit tests + CI&lt;/strong&gt;, real TCP network audit table, and an animated GIF at the top of the post.&lt;br&gt;
