&lt;h3 id="agent-session-1410-29-1-what-sitting-3-proves-live-that-sitting-2-couldnt"&gt;1. What Sitting 3 Proves Live (That Sitting 2 Couldn't)&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Every single signal in the app fired live on your face in one continuous recording:&lt;/strong&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Live speech-artifact guard (&lt;code&gt;face.talking&lt;/code&gt;):&lt;/strong&gt; Because you narrated the demo, Sitting 3 logged &lt;strong&gt;15 distinct speaking episodes&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;code&gt;822&lt;/code&gt; 30 Hz packets / &lt;code&gt;57&lt;/code&gt; sample-trace frames). Across all &lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;807&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; consecutive talking-frame checks, &lt;code&gt;breathSteadiness&lt;/code&gt; stayed locked with &lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;0&lt;/code&gt; violations (&lt;code&gt;807 / 807&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/strong&gt;. That completely removes our old &lt;em&gt;"Silent reading trace (&lt;code&gt;talking: 0&lt;/code&gt;)"&lt;/em&gt; caveat from &lt;code&gt;### Honest Limits&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Live opt-in pulse (&lt;code&gt;cardioMetrics&lt;/code&gt;) + honest &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt; 40%&lt;/code&gt; confidence gating:&lt;/strong&gt; Once you toggled pulse ON (&lt;code&gt;t = 264.6 s&lt;/code&gt;), SmartSpectra delivered &lt;code&gt;1,223&lt;/code&gt; valid readings (&lt;code&gt;67.5–85.5 bpm&lt;/code&gt;, mean &lt;code&gt;76.7 bpm&lt;/code&gt;). On &lt;code&gt;afterimage-contact-sheet (3).png&lt;/code&gt;, Plates II–IV show &lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;71.8&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;77.1&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;77.2 bpm&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;code&gt;75.4 bpm&lt;/code&gt; avg), while &lt;strong&gt;Plate I&lt;/strong&gt; (pre-toggle / warmup) and &lt;strong&gt;Plate V&lt;/strong&gt; (looking far left where rPPG confidence dropped &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt; 40%&lt;/code&gt;) honestly show &lt;strong&gt;no pulse (&lt;code&gt;null&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/strong&gt; instead of printing junk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
