&lt;h2 id="agent-session-1410-1-2-rules--consent-audit-vs-live-challenge-page"&gt;2. Rules &amp;amp; Consent Audit vs. Live Challenge Page&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Audited against the &lt;a href="https://dev.to/challenges/presage-2026-11-04"&gt;challenge page&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://dev.to/page/presage-2026-11-04-contest-rules"&gt;Contest Rules&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://dev.to/page/official-hackathon-rules"&gt;General Contest Official Rules&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href="https://presagetech.com/legal/privacy-policy" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Presage Legal Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id="agent-session-1410-1-what-hush_planmd-got-right"&gt;What &lt;code&gt;HUSH_PLAN.md&lt;/code&gt; Got Right&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Timeline:&lt;/strong&gt; Closes &lt;strong&gt;Nov 22, 2026 at 11:59 PM PST&lt;/strong&gt; = &lt;strong&gt;Mon Nov 23, 8:59 AM WAT (Nigeria time)&lt;/strong&gt;. Winners announced &lt;strong&gt;Dec 10, 2026&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Eligibility (Nigeria, Solo, 18+):&lt;/strong&gt; Solo only (no teams), 18+, one entry per participant, development must start within Nov 4–22. &lt;strong&gt;Nigeria is NOT on the 18-country exclusion list&lt;/strong&gt; in the General Contest Official Rules. &lt;em&gt;(Note: winners must return eligibility/publicity/tax forms within **7 business days&lt;/em&gt;* of notification or forfeit.)*&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Non-medical boundaries:&lt;/strong&gt; Avoiding diagnosis/treatment claims and requiring explicit opt-in consent matches the rules—&lt;strong&gt;except&lt;/strong&gt; watch your Section 2 mention of HRV "stress index" (never expose "stress" framing in UI/post).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id="agent-session-1410-1-rule--compliance-errors-in-hush_planmd"&gt;Rule &amp;amp; Compliance Errors in &lt;code&gt;HUSH_PLAN.md&lt;/code&gt;
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;False Privacy &amp;amp; "No AI Service" Claims (Severe Compliance Defect):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;code&gt;HUSH_PLAN.md&lt;/code&gt; (lines 55–57, 112–113, 122–124) tells users and judges: &lt;em&gt;"The SmartSpectra SDK contacts Presage's server only to check the app's API key. We've turned its anonymous usage telemetry off"&lt;/em&gt; and &lt;em&gt;"The optional 'LLM Insights' feature sends data to an AI service. We don't use it."&lt;/em&gt; / &lt;em&gt;"No AI service."&lt;/em&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Live facts (Presage SmartSpectra SDK Privacy Policy, effective Nov 3, 2026, plus &lt;a href="https://smartspectra.presagetech.com/docs/llm-insights" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;LLM Insights Overview&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://smartspectra.presagetech.com/docs/telemetry-and-privacy" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Telemetry &amp;amp; Privacy&lt;/a&gt;):&lt;/strong&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Auto-fired AI Insights to Anthropic:&lt;/strong&gt; Whenever &lt;strong&gt;both breathing (default) and cardio metrics are active&lt;/strong&gt;—which &lt;code&gt;HUSH_PLAN.md&lt;/code&gt; enables—the SDK &lt;strong&gt;automatically&lt;/strong&gt; buffers pulse rate, HRV, and breathing rate and sends snapshots to Presage → &lt;strong&gt;Anthropic, PBC&lt;/strong&gt; (at pulse lock ~15 s, breathing ~30 s, HRV ~60 s, and every 60 s thereafter), even if you never call &lt;code&gt;requestInsight()&lt;/code&gt;. SDK Privacy Policy §7.4 explicitly states: &lt;em&gt;"Insights are generated automatically during SDK sessions and **cannot currently be turned off by Developers or End Users&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;. Developers **must tell their End Users&lt;/em&gt;* about this processing and obtain any consent the law requires."* Claiming &lt;em&gt;"No AI service"&lt;/em&gt; when both breathing and cardio are enabled is &lt;strong&gt;factually false&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Server traffic beyond API key checks:&lt;/strong&gt; Per SDK Privacy Policy §4.3–4.4, the SDK also transmits app attestation tokens, hashed device identifiers, SDK version, IP address, model-delivery requests, and session/usage records (session/batch IDs, start/end times, measurement counts). &lt;em&gt;"Turning telemetry off does not turn off authentication, model delivery or Insights."&lt;/em&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;"Anonymous telemetry" wording:&lt;/strong&gt; Presage's own &lt;a href="https://smartspectra.presagetech.com/docs/telemetry-and-privacy" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Telemetry &amp;amp; Privacy&lt;/a&gt; page explicitly instructs: &lt;em&gt;"Do not describe this collection as anonymous or categorically unlinked to identity."&lt;/em&gt; Even when disabling it (&lt;code&gt;enableTelemetry: false&lt;/code&gt;), drop the word "anonymous."&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;SDK Cache &amp;amp; Retention:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;code&gt;@smartspectra/node-sdk/main&lt;/code&gt; initializes a native cache folder under Electron's &lt;code&gt;app.getPath('cache')/&amp;lt;appName&amp;gt;/SmartSpectraSDK&lt;/code&gt; (for EMD device keys). Your "Delete all data" button wipes only your local run JSON, not the SDK cache or Presage's server logs (retained up to 365 days; Insights retained while the developer account is active + 60 days after close).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;18+ SDK Policy Requirement:&lt;/strong&gt; SDK Privacy Policy §13.1 prohibits developers from running the SDK with users under 18—add this to your consent screen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Missing Template Tag:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;code&gt;HUSH_PLAN.md&lt;/code&gt; lists only &lt;code&gt;#presagechallenge&lt;/code&gt;, whereas the live challenge Submission Template prefills &lt;code&gt;tags: devchallenge, presagechallenge&lt;/code&gt;. Include both tags.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optional but encouraged: embed an AI coding transcript via &lt;code&gt;dev.to/agent_sessions/new&lt;/code&gt; (unlisted by default—remember to click &lt;strong&gt;Make Public&lt;/strong&gt; and strip &lt;code&gt;.env&lt;/code&gt;/API keys).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


