&lt;strong&gt;Direction A — &lt;code&gt;35mm Silver-Halide Darkroom&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt; Obsidian darkroom, safelight amber (&lt;code&gt;#d9822b&lt;/code&gt;), top 35mm sprocket strip with live amber blink-cut notches, optical haze clearing as breath steadies. Strongest dark-room photographic metaphor; high contrast for webcam viewing.&lt;/li&gt;
