&lt;h3 id="agent-session-1410-9-3-exact-high-leverage-fixes-needed-to-actually-make-it-win-quality"&gt;3. Exact High-Leverage Fixes Needed to Actually Make It Win-Quality&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;If you want to push &lt;code&gt;AFTERIMAGE&lt;/code&gt; across the winning line (in order of impact):&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;First: Verify live face + chest data on your actual webcam (5 min):&lt;/strong&gt;
Sit well-lit facing the uncovered camera and run:
&lt;code&gt;powershell
npm run spike -- --skip-readiness --seconds 20
&lt;/code&gt;
Paste the &lt;code&gt;[1s]&lt;/code&gt; lines so we see real &lt;code&gt;x&lt;/code&gt;/&lt;code&gt;y&lt;/code&gt; landmark bounds (&lt;code&gt;0..1&lt;/code&gt; vs &lt;code&gt;960×540&lt;/code&gt;), real blink counts, and real &lt;code&gt;upperTrace&lt;/code&gt; amplitudes on your hardware.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Fix all 5 real runtime/UX bugs (&lt;code&gt;signal-processor.mjs&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;server.mjs&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;ExperiencePage.tsx&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;CalibratePage.tsx&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;useSignals.ts&lt;/code&gt;):&lt;/strong&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Blink-on-reopen (&lt;code&gt;&amp;lt; 650 ms&lt;/code&gt;) + &lt;code&gt;1.1 s&lt;/code&gt; long-blink pause without premature cutting + &lt;strong&gt;visible "Shutter Ready" dwell lock (~4.5 s per beat)&lt;/strong&gt; so natural reading blinks never rip you through the essay in 45 s.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aspect-aware EAR + &lt;code&gt;face.talking&lt;/code&gt; pause guard ("Speaking pauses chest tracking").&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix the 30 Hz &lt;code&gt;flushSceneStats&lt;/code&gt; cleanup loop, &lt;code&gt;Shift&lt;/code&gt; hold bug, and &lt;code&gt;/calibrate&lt;/code&gt; → &lt;code&gt;/experience&lt;/code&gt; camera restart race.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wire real &lt;strong&gt;JSONL session recording&lt;/strong&gt; into &lt;code&gt;bridge/server.mjs&lt;/code&gt; and replace &lt;code&gt;web/public/sample-trace.json&lt;/code&gt; with &lt;strong&gt;one genuine 90–120 s SmartSpectra recording from your webcam&lt;/strong&gt; (zero video, real metrics replayed through the exact same &lt;code&gt;SignalProcessor&lt;/code&gt;!).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Make the 5 scenes feel genuinely alive &amp;amp; fix the PNG Contact Sheet (&lt;code&gt;SceneArt.tsx&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;soundscape.ts&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;exportSheet.ts&lt;/code&gt;):&lt;/strong&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Couple live &lt;code&gt;breathing.upperTrace&lt;/code&gt; directly into organic motion inside every scene (rising steam curls, drifting dust motes in volumetric light shafts, falling raindrop trails, breathing lamp halo, smooth cross-faded gaze lighting instead of harsh rectangular dim boxes) + soft WebAudio ambient room/rain texture and bell overtone when hidden marginalia develops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Render the &lt;strong&gt;actual 5 bespoke scene artworks&lt;/strong&gt; onto the exported &lt;code&gt;1600×920&lt;/code&gt; &lt;code&gt;.png&lt;/code&gt; Contact Sheet (plus honest "Unvisited" handling—never faking sine waves) so the downloaded print is genuinely share-worthy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Deploy to Vercel (&lt;code&gt;vercel --prod&lt;/code&gt;) &amp;amp; shoot one clean 90-second uncut live-webcam demo video&lt;/strong&gt; (showing you seated live, looking L/C/R, breathing steady to develop a hidden line, blinking to cut, and downloading the real Contact Sheet PNG).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Tell me if you want to run &lt;code&gt;npm run spike -- --skip-readiness --seconds 20&lt;/code&gt; first and then tackle items #2–#3 in clean atomic commits right away.&lt;/p&gt;

