2. &lt;strong&gt;Opt-in Pulse (&lt;code&gt;cardioMetrics&lt;/code&gt;):&lt;/strong&gt; Did toggling it ON on &lt;code&gt;/calibrate&lt;/code&gt; show a live BPM reading, or did it stay &lt;code&gt;warming up&lt;/code&gt; under auto-exposure?&lt;/p&gt;



