&lt;h3 id="agent-session-1410-19-fixed--pushed-128558a"&gt;Fixed &amp;amp; Pushed (&lt;code&gt;128558a&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;bridge/signal-processor.mjs&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Replaced the averaged &lt;code&gt;computeGazeScalar&lt;/code&gt; blend (&lt;code&gt;irisRatio * 0.7 + yawRatio * 0.3&lt;/code&gt;) with additive deviation fusion around center (&lt;code&gt;0.5 + (irisRatio - 0.5) * 0.95 + (yawRatio - 0.5) * 0.55&lt;/code&gt;) so eye glances and natural head movement amplify rather than dilute each other.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tightened 3-zone thresholds from &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt; 0.41 / &amp;gt; 0.59&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;code&gt;0.46 / 0.54&lt;/code&gt; return) to &lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;&amp;lt; 0.455 / &amp;gt; 0.545&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;code&gt;0.478 / 0.522&lt;/code&gt; return), staying outside resting jitter (&lt;code&gt;~0.486–0.493&lt;/code&gt;) while responding to gentle glances across a laptop screen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;bridge/signal-processor.test.mjs&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt; Added subtle-glance (&lt;code&gt;gazeOffset = ±0.25&lt;/code&gt;) assertions across &lt;code&gt;left&lt;/code&gt; → &lt;code&gt;right&lt;/code&gt; → &lt;code&gt;center&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
