&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thoughtful Real-World Track (why AFTERIMAGE shouldn't dilute itself chasing this track):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
- &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://dev.to/jonathansolvesstuff/unskipped-see-where-your-beta-reader-stopped-caring-as-page-flags-in-your-own-manuscript-4j6c"&gt;Unskipped&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;: Validated against a real &lt;strong&gt;fingertip pulse oximeter&lt;/strong&gt; (29/29 readings within 5 bpm), exports real Word/Google Docs comments, &lt;code&gt;npm run check&lt;/code&gt; fails if any blog post number disagrees with committed traces, and the author contacted the Quebec Writers' Federation.&lt;br&gt;
- &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://dev.to/aryan_anand_0713/trustfall-i-crash-tested-smartspectras-stable-flag-with-one-minute-of-my-face-35i3"&gt;TrustFall&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;: Metamorphic crash-testing across &lt;strong&gt;17 SDK sessions / 988 half-second readings&lt;/strong&gt; proving a 2% light flicker fools &lt;code&gt;stable&lt;/code&gt; 62/62 times.&lt;br&gt;
- &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://dev.to/mzee04/twenty-a-shared-pause-when-a-conversation-runs-hot-209n"&gt;Twenty&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;code&gt;mzee04&lt;/code&gt;, your Week 4 Overall Winner), &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://dev.to/samarth_kumble_a91ad88634/practical-a-webcam-physiology-lab-that-grades-itself-against-a-wrist-count-3adp"&gt;Practical&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://dev.to/tushar_shah/preppulse-a-pressure-map-for-exam-practice-built-on-smartspectra-265g"&gt;PrepPulse&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://dev.to/gavin_rose/onblink-communicate-with-minimal-movement-3ag3"&gt;OnBlink&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; (an actual AAC communicator for non-speaking users with labeled key-press blink evals).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Notice the pattern across &lt;em&gt;Upbeat&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Long Exposure&lt;/em&gt;, and &lt;em&gt;Breathblown&lt;/em&gt;: &lt;strong&gt;all three entered ONLY &lt;code&gt;Most Creative or Delightful Use&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt; Entering &lt;code&gt;Best Thoughtful Real-World Use&lt;/code&gt; with a "calm-tech hands-free reading" pitch puts AFTERIMAGE directly against oximeter-validated studies and real disability AAC tools—which makes the post feel stretched rather than focused.&lt;/p&gt;


