&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;next: { revalidate: 3600 }&lt;/code&gt; tells Next.js to cache the response and refresh it in the background at most once an hour. We also map &lt;code&gt;items&lt;/code&gt; down to the fields we render, so less data is serialized into the page for the client component.&lt;/p&gt;

